WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
To know how bad an event is for someone, we need to think about what exactly happened,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.220
the person's culture, and the person's own feelings.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.419
But that's not all.

00:00:11.419 --> 00:00:16.420
We also want to think about how each kid might react to the bad event, because everyone

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.580
reacts in different ways.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.339
One thing they found is that people who have bad things happen to them might want to stay

00:00:25.339 --> 00:00:26.339
away.

00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:31.620
Avoidance means trying not to be near the things you don't like.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.939
And while some might become avoidant, others might get aggressive.

00:00:35.939 --> 00:00:40.439
That is, if they think someone or something can hurt them, they might want to hurt it

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.039
first.

